// prompt under a vendor message uuid computed from the turn id the daemon
// minted (a turn id that is itself a uuid — a prompt the vendor recorded
// first — is its own vendor uuid), so a restarted shim finds the prompt's
// record in the vendor transcript with nothing stored anywhere.
//
